COMMON='''Create ONE transparent RGBA production sprite sheet for exactly the supplied original enemy identity, using ONLY the attached minimal reference. Preserve its age, face or nonhuman mechanism, materials, costume, complete weapons/appendages and body proportions. Painterly grounded Western-fantasy game art consistent with the reference, clean readable silhouette, controlled cold/warm light as specified. No parchment/background, cast ground shadow, labels, borders, text, UI or extra characters. Reference paper texture, nearby object fragments and historical labels are NOT part of the target. Do not borrow another named person's face. Do not crop heads, toes, weapon tips, hooks, antennae, rings, or the shared base. Ample transparent gutter in EVERY cell. No mirroring one side to invent the other.
OUTPUT: square1536x1536, exactly4 columns x4 rows. Each column has an independently drawn actual direction: column1 DOWN/front toward viewer, column2 LEFT/profile looking screen-left, column3 UP/back away, column4 RIGHT/profile looking screen-right. Keep that order exactly. Consistent camera, lighting, actual scale and ground/support-plane projection across all16 drawings. No per-frame fitting to fill the box. Torso/chassis/hip reference height stays continuous during movement; do not align every forward toe tip to one screen baseline. Attack can crouch genuinely. Keep full anatomy and weapons within each cell.
CANONICAL ID: {id}; name: {name}. ONLY THIS ID. Identity invariants: {identity}
PRIMARY COMBAT DRAWING: {primary}. Runtime pose key: {pose}. Actual gameplay timings/geometry belong to code; do not draw warning UI or invent attacks.
REFERENCE EXCLUSIONS: {neighbors}
{history}
'''
TEMPLATES={
 'human':COMMON+'''ANATOMY: one adult HUMAN of the supplied sex/age/body build with exactly two legs and ordinary human hands;7–7.5-head adult proportions, same face in every direction and frame. Keep the held props and correct closed grips in ALL walking poses. Four ROWS are: row1 neutral combat-ready IDLE; row2 WALK A clear extended contact stance; row3 WALK B a clearly DIFFERENT passing pose with the free knee lifted and its boot under the pelvis while the support leg is planted, not a second almost-identical wide stride; row4 the specified committed PRIMARY action. Walking head/torso scale and hip position stay stable with a slight natural gait change only. Show distinct foot/leg silhouettes in both side views. No jumping, gliding, giant muscles, baby faces or different costume.
''',
 'mechanical-supports':COMMON+'''ANATOMY: a NONHUMAN mechanical construct with exactly {supports} weight-bearing supports as specified. Preserve every genuine articulated leg, foot, antenna, ring, hammer, mirror and chassis component; no human arms/face/skin added, no missing/extra legs. For supports2/3/4/6, rows are: row1 IDLE; row2 WALK A with a credible support/contact set; row3 WALK B clearly different articulated stance (opposite diagonal support pairs for4/6 legs, passing/support change for2, coordinated tripod tilt/contact for3); row4 PRIMARY action. Keep rigid chassis/core height and proportions continuous across rows1–3, legs bend below it rather than the whole machine jumping to align the nearest toe. The ground anchor is the center of its support polygon/chassis projection, not the lowest forward toe or tool tip. For supports0 ONLY (U2-3), retain ZERO legs: rows2/3 are opposite subtle physical ring/lens tilts while moving, not walking; retain the same low physical lens height above its ground projection, never a ghost or levitating human.
''',
 'three-statues-one-plinth':COMMON+'''SPECIAL ONE-BASE FORMATION: all THREE hollow bronze sword statues remain physically attached to the SAME SINGLE complete low plinth in each cell. One logical enemy silhouette and base, not three separate enemy sprites and not three crops. No human faces inside. No additional statues. This is STATIONARY architecture: do not invent walking legs, marching, hopping or a translating pedestal. Rows are: row1 all three neutral with full base; row2 first blade clearly raised/ready with other two statues retained; row3 second blade clearly raised/ready with other two retained; row4 third blade committed cleave with other two retained. In each column, turn the complete formation/base consistently to the actual view; do not swap statue identities. Preserve the base support-plane center, full swords and all mechanical feet. Four frames are a minimum pose source, not a claim that runtime per-step animation or three origin anchors are already implemented.
''',
}

def sha(path):return hashlib.sha256(path.read_bytes()).hexdigest()
def write(path,value):path.write_text(json.dumps(value,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n','utf-8')
def rel(path):return str(path.relative_to(ROOT)).replace('\\','/')

def main():
    OUTPUT.mkdir(exist_ok=True);refs=OUTPUT/'references';prompts=OUTPUT/'prompts';templates=OUTPUT/'templates'
    for directory in [refs,prompts,templates]:directory.mkdir(exist_ok=True)
    plan=json.loads((ART/'actor-pilot-v1/remaining-31-reference-plan.json').read_text('utf-8'))
    profiles=json.loads((ART/'combat-runtime-v1/enemy-combat-profiles.json').read_text('utf-8'))
    pending=[item for item in plan['pending']if not item.get('generationStarted',False)]
    assert len(pending)==30 and {item['id']for item in pending}==set(SPECS)
    for key,value in TEMPLATES.items():(templates/(key+'.txt')).write_text(value,'utf-8')
    boards={};items=[]
    for item in pending:
        identity=item['id'];rect,template,supports,invariants,primary=SPECS[identity]
        board=ROOT/item['board'];source_sha=sha(board);assert source_sha==item['boardSha256']
        if board not in boards:boards[board]=Image.open(board).convert('RGB')
        original=boards[board];assert original.size==(1254,1254)
        crop=original.crop(rect);reference=refs/(identity.lower().replace('_','-')+'-reference.png');crop.save(reference)
        assert Image.open(reference).tobytes()==original.crop(rect).tobytes()
        profile=profiles[identity];move=profile['attacks'][profile['cycle'][0]]
        history=item.get('poseAdaptation','')
        if identity=='BOSS_R4':history+=' Use the explicit R4 top-left Adrian reference. The historical rivals-v5-balanced sheet labels its officer RODERICK; no same-person alias is authorized, so that face is NOT a reference.'
        params=dict(id=identity,name=item['name'],identity=invariants,primary=primary,pose=move['pose'],neighbors=NEIGHBORS.get(identity,'No known neighboring subject fragment is intentionally required. Ignore any isolated perimeter speck; do not add another figure.'),history=history,supports=supports)
        prompt=prompts/(identity.lower().replace('_','-')+'-sheet-prompt.txt');prompt.write_text(TEMPLATES[template].format(**params),'utf-8')
        required_moves=[dict(id=m['id'],label=m['label'],pose=m['pose'],stepIds=[s['id']for s in m['steps']],stepTimings=[dict(windup=s['windup'],lock=s['lock'],active=s['active'])for s in m['steps']])for m in profile['attacks'].values()]
        anchor='Support polygon/chassis projection, not nearest toe; keep rigid core height stable.'if template=='mechanical-supports'else'Pelvis/support-plane projection using stable torso/head landmarks; attack support soles rather than weapon tip.'
        if template=='three-statues-one-plinth':anchor='One shared plinth support-plane center. All three complete statues remain grouped; no single-body connected-component assumption.'
        if identity=='U2-3':anchor='Ground projection below the low physical glass lens; no invented sole/leg anchor, no unreachable floating collider.'
        record=dict(id=identity,name=item['name'],region=item['region'],proposedConceptId=item['proposedConceptId'],bodyTemplate=template,supportCount=supports,identityInvariants=invariants,primaryDrawing=primary,primaryRuntimeMove=move['id'],primaryRuntimePose=move['pose'],requiredCombatMoves=required_moves,reference=dict(sourceBoard=rel(board),sourceSize=list(original.size),sourceMode='RGB',sourceSha256=source_sha,sourcePosition=item['boardPosition'],cropRect=rect,cropSize=list(crop.size),cropFile=rel(reference),cropSha256=sha(reference),exactSourcePixels=True,alphaRemovalPerformed=False,sourceGenerationPrompt=item['sourceGenerationPrompt'],neighborFragmentsToIgnore=NEIGHBORS.get(identity,'none known; visual review still required')),promptFile=rel(prompt),templateFile=rel(templates/(template+'.txt')),anchorBasis=anchor,generation=dict(status='not-started',providerPlanned='OpenAI cloud image_gen',output=None,outputSha256=None),review=dict(referenceCrop='prepared-awaiting-root-contact-review',generationArt='not-generated',runtime='not-installed'),requestedSheet=dict(size=[1536,1536],columns=['down','left','up','right'],rows=['idle','walk-a','walk-b','primary']if template!='three-statues-one-plinth'else['idle','first-blade-ready','second-blade-ready','third-blade-cleave'],actualOutputDimensionsAndDirectionOrderMustBeInspected=True,productionAtlas=[1024,1024],productionResample='One whole1536 atlas ->1024 at2/3, all pixel coordinates x2/3 and worldUnitsPerPixel /2/3; never per-frame fitting'),limitations=['Minimal first sheet covers a primary action drawing only. All requiredCombatMoves remain explicit; no full multi-step action-library acceptance is implied.','Concept reference crop is not an installed animation, hit/death pose, collision or3D model.'])
        if history:record['sourceHistoryAdaptation']=history
        if template=='three-statues-one-plinth':record['runtimeAdapterNeeds']=['Stationary shared base; no fabricated walk animation.','Per-step first/second/third sword pose selection and scene-authored three attack origins require explicit runtime adaptation/review.']
        items.append(record)
    assert len({item['reference']['cropFile']for item in items})==30
    # One contact sheet <=1600 in BOTH dimensions, clear ID labels and source crops.
    cw,ch=250,304;contact=Image.new('RGB',(cw*6,ch*5),(43,43,47));draw=ImageDraw.Draw(contact)
    font_path=Path('C:/Windows/Fonts/msyh.ttc');font=ImageFont.truetype(str(font_path),15)if font_path.exists()else ImageFont.load_default()
    small=ImageFont.truetype(str(font_path),12)if font_path.exists()else ImageFont.load_default()
    for index,item in enumerate(items):
        x=index%6*cw;y=index//6*ch;image=Image.open(ROOT/item['reference']['cropFile']);image.thumbnail((cw-14,ch-55),Image.Resampling.LANCZOS)
        contact.paste(image,(x+(cw-image.width)//2,y+4+(ch-55-image.height)//2))
        draw.text((x+8,y+ch-46),item['id']+' '+item['name'],font=font,fill=(240,222,182))
        draw.text((x+8,y+ch-23),item['primaryRuntimePose']+('  ! neighbor'if item['id']in NEIGHBORS else''),font=small,fill=(212,211,209))
    contact.save(OUTPUT/'reference-contact-30.jpg',quality=94)
    contact.save(OUTPUT/'reference-contact-30-final.jpg',quality=94)
    registry=dict(schemaVersion=1,status='30 minimal references and prompts prepared; no generation/runtime writes',scope=dict(common=19,bosses=11,total=30),excludedRetained={'R1-1':'raider','R1-2':'raider-shield','R1-3':'raider-archer','BOSS_R1':'captain'},excludedPilots={'R2-1':'mine-worker','R2-3':'mine-crawler'},authority=dict(campaign='source-art/skills/pure-skills-v2/campaign-v8.json',worldDesign='docs/design/world-combat-v4.md',combatData='source-art/encounters/cloud-world-v2/combat-runtime-v1/enemy-combat-profiles.json',combatDataSha256=sha(ART/'combat-runtime-v1/enemy-combat-profiles.json')),contactSheet=rel(OUTPUT/'reference-contact-30.jpg'),contactSize=list(contact.size),cropPolicy='Explicit per-subject rectangles, complete weapons/supports/plinth favored over hard grid. Native RGB source pixels retained; no generated/background-removal pixels. Neighbor fragments explicitly excluded in per-ID prompts.',generationStarted=False,runtimeWritten=False,identityConflicts=[dict(id='BOSS_R4',unusedSource='assets/concepts/revision-v5/rivals-v5-balanced.png',actualHistoricalLabel='RODERICK',samePersonAliasAuthorized=False,resolution='Root confirmed: use only current explicit cloud R4 top-left Adrian identity; do not borrow historical named face')],items=items)
    write(OUTPUT/'registry.json',registry)
    write(OUTPUT/'generation-records.json',dict(status='not-started',records=[dict(id=item['id'],reference=item['reference']['cropFile'],referenceSha256=item['reference']['cropSha256'],prompt=item['promptFile'],providerPlanned='OpenAI cloud image_gen',generationStatus='not-started',generatedOutput=None,generatedSha256=None,generatedDimensions=None,generationArtReview='not-generated',runtimeInstalled=False)for item in items]))
    (OUTPUT/'README.md').write_text('# Remaining30 enemy identity references\n\nSource-only preparation:19 ordinary enemies and11 bosses. No image-generation tool, model, download, dependency or runtime resource write is performed. The existing4 R1 identities and2 R2 pilots are excluded.\n\n`reference-contact-30.jpg` is1500×1520 for one-pass review. `registry.json` records every canonical ID, source board size/crop/SHA, exact native RGB crop, identity invariants, primary runtime pose, every required move, anchor exception, neighbor exclusion and ready prompt. `generation-records.json` is a not-started ledger; successful generation, independent art review and runtime acceptance must be filled separately from actual evidence.\n\n`tools/design/prepare-enemy-reference-batch.py` deterministically rebuilds crops, contact, registry and prompts. Reference crops preserve paper and source pixels; they are not cutout animations. Templates distinguish human gait, nonhuman support mechanisms (including explicit zero-leg lens exception), and stationary three-statues-on-one-plinth. Multi-step bosses need their additional poses/step timing after a minimal primary sheet; this preparation does not assert full action coverage.\n\nAdrian uses only the explicit current R4 top-left reference. Historical RODERICK artwork has no authorized same-person alias and is not attached as a face reference.\n','utf-8')
    print('Prepared30 exact RGB reference crops,30 prompts,3 distinct templates, registry/empty generation ledger and1500x1520 contact; no generation/runtime writes.')

if __name__=='__main__':main()
